OL,3,GNEWSABrain tumour patient home just
OL,4,Ahours after surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first patient to be discharged from
OL,7,Fa Hull hospital the same day as
OL,8,Fundergoing brain surgery to remove a
OL,9,Ftumour and part of his skull says he
OL,10,Fwas "really glad to get home."
OL,12,FDean Richardson, 61, had a benign,
OL,13,Fnon-cancerous tumour removed during an
OL,14,Foperation at Hull Royal Infirmary in
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FHe was fitted with a bespoke plate to
OL,18,Fcover the missing part of his skull and
OL,19,Fwas sent home 12 hours after he had
OL,20,Fbeen taken to theatre.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
